[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5734384404","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123614#issuecomment-5734384404","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123614","id":5734384404,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABVcvDFA","user":{"login":"blueskythlikesclouds","id":19259897,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MjU5ODk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19259897?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds","html_url":"https://github.com/blueskythlikesclouds","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-18T18:24:25Z","updated_at":"2026-09-18T18:24:25Z","body":"Note to self: IMG BXM-8-256 is also affected but it's not a Rogue GPU so it'll fail the check here.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5734384404/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5891365140","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123614#issuecomment-5891365140","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123614","id":5891365140,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABXycZFA","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-29T13:33:33Z","updated_at":"2026-09-29T13:33:33Z","body":"> Note to self: IMG BXM-8-256 is also affected but it's not a Rogue GPU so it'll fail the check here.\r\n\r\nI'd suggest trying something like this:\r\n```diff\r\n@@ -758,8 +758,10 @@ void RenderingDeviceDriverVulkan::_check_driver_workarounds(const VkPhysicalDevi\r\n        // Workaround for a bug in NVIDIA drivers where submitting a render pass with no bound pipeline and an attachment using the \"Don't Care\" store operation causes a crash.\r\n        driver_workarounds.avoid_store_op_dont_care_in_draw_list_with_no_bound_pipeline = (p_device_properties.vendorID == RenderingContextDriver::Vendor::VENDOR_NVIDIA);\r\n \r\n-       // Workaround for shader compilers (\"libufwriter.so\") in PowerVR Rogue GPUs where creating shader modules or pipelines concurrently causes a crash.\r\n-       if (p_device_properties.vendorID == RenderingContextDriver::Vendor::VENDOR_IMGTEC && strstr(p_device_properties.deviceName, \"Rogue\") != nullptr) {\r\n+       // Workaround for shader compiler (\"libufwriter.so\") in PowerVR Rogue GPUs (and some B-Series BXM-8-256)\r\n+       // where creating shader modules or pipelines concurrently causes a crash.\r\n+       if (p_device_properties.vendorID == RenderingContextDriver::Vendor::VENDOR_IMGTEC &&\r\n+                       (strstr(p_device_properties.deviceName, \"Rogue\") != nullptr || strstr(p_device_properties.deviceName, \"BXM-8-256\") != nullptr)) {\r\n                powervr_rogue_shader_crash_workaround_mutex = memnew(BinaryMutex); // Non-null mutex pointer enables the workaround.\r\n        }\r\n }\r\n```\r\n\r\nThen we should merge sooner than later so we can test this in the 4.8 beta phase.\r\n\r\nCC @clayjohn for review.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5891365140/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5910725772","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123614#issuecomment-5910725772","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123614","id":5910725772,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABYE6EjA","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-30T11:55:40Z","updated_at":"2026-09-30T11:55:40Z","body":"I currently have 4 devices with `PowerVR Rogue GE8322` GPU (Android 11, 12, 13).\r\nhttps://chat.godotengine.org/channel/android/thread/rcjTrpYLTS34YQL2K\r\n\r\n---------\r\n\r\n> 3d platformer demo from godot-demo-projects\r\n\r\nIs there anything else I should test?\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5910725772/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6017542328","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123614#issuecomment-6017542328","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123614","id":6017542328,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABZqxouA","user":{"login":"blueskythlikesclouds","id":19259897,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MjU5ODk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19259897?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds","html_url":"https://github.com/blueskythlikesclouds","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlike